<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="heading">我的收据</view><view class="muted">原收据保留当时收款金额，退款金额请查看退费记录。PDF查看菜单可保存或转发。</view></view><view class="state error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button class="small" bindtap="onPullDownRefresh">重新加载</button></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="receiptId"><view class="row"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.statusText}}</view></view><view class="muted number">{{item.receiptNo}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.studentName}} · {{item.issuedTime}}</view><view class="row"><view>凭据金额</view><view class="price">{{item.amountText}}</view></view><view class="muted">{{item.fileText}}</view><view class="safe" wx:if="{{item.financeMode === 'MOCK'}}">模拟凭据 · 不涉及真实资金</view><button class="primary" wx:if="{{item.canDownload}}" data-id="{{item.receiptId}}" bindtap="open" loading="{{opening === item.receiptId}}" disabled="{{opening}}">查看 / 保存PDF</button><view class="notice" wx:elif="{{item.receiptStatus === 'VOID'}}">此凭据已作废，请使用补开的有效凭据。</view><view class="notice" wx:else>收款状态不受文件生成影响。文件尚未就绪，请稍后刷新；持续失败请联系财务重试。</view></view><view class="state" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view><view class="state" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !rows.length}}">暂无收据</view></view>
